# test Program version

# this feature is disabled by default
Sòti ekri: (
	Pwogram fonksyonalite: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), nouvo-liy.


# but if we set the time back
>> today := Moman 
zòn: ['CEST'],
apati: ['2026-02-15 10:00:00'].
Pwogram vèsyon: today.

